{'symbol': 'MPWR', 'date': '2022-12-12 06:00:00', 'title': 'MONOLITHIC POWER SYSTEMS SIGNS AGREEMENT WITH VANGUARD INTERNATIONAL TO SECURE SEMICONDUCTOR SUPPLY', 'text': "KIRKLAND, WASH., DEC. 12, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0MONOLITHIC POWER SYSTEMS, INC. (MPS) (NASDAQ: MPWR), A LEADING COMPANY IN HIGH-PERFORMANCE POWER SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MPS AND VANGUARD INTERNATIONAL SEMICONDUCTOR CORPORATION (VIS), A LEADING SPECIALTY IC FOUNDRY SERVICE PROVIDER,\xa0HAVE ENTERED INTO A FOUNDRY AGREEMENT TO PRODUCE POWER SEMICONDUCTORS. MPS WILL UTILIZE VIS'S 8-INCH (200MM) WAFER FABRICATION CAPABILITIES IN ITS SINGAPORE AND TAIWAN MANUFACTURING FACILITIES."}